Id: ngx002w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_nginx
Fix: Log somewhere: access_log /var/log/nginx/access.log.
References: ngx_http_log_module
Controls: CIS 8.2, 8.5; NIST AU-2, AU-12; ISO 8.15

A server never logs requests: access_log is off, and nothing in its
locations logs either. Without request logs an intrusion leaves no
trace here: no addresses, no URLs, no time to start from.
